1
00:00:08,920 --> 00:00:14,360
(11:50-12:00 PM)

2
00:00:14,360 --> 00:00:19,400
(11:50-12:00 PM)

3
00:00:20,653 --> 00:00:23,760
♪Your silhouette melts into the glow♪

4
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:26,680
(Congrats to our grand prize winner!
Prize money: 100,000 yuan)

5
00:00:27,160 --> 00:00:30,872
♪I count your sighs♪

6
00:00:32,482 --> 00:00:34,680
♪Every breath♪

7
00:00:34,804 --> 00:00:37,560
♪Feels like I'm stealing♪

8
00:00:39,630 --> 00:00:41,157
♪The next second♪

9
00:00:41,604 --> 00:00:44,357
♪Before it's no longer mine♪

10
00:00:48,023 --> 00:00:50,628
♪We live♪
(Capernaum)

11
00:00:50,628 --> 00:00:54,277
♪In the spaces between moments♪

12
00:00:56,210 --> 00:01:00,840
♪Breathing through each other's shadows♪

13
00:01:02,243 --> 00:01:05,000
♪Let's not speak of what's to come♪

14
00:01:05,317 --> 00:01:08,177
♪Or what came before♪

15
00:01:09,769 --> 00:01:14,589
♪This moment could last me a lifetime♪
(12:00-11:50 PM)

16
00:01:17,886 --> 00:01:21,000
=Thirteen Types of Love=
=Episode 3=

17
00:01:21,280 --> 00:01:22,040
For this event,

18
00:01:22,120 --> 00:01:25,040
we're combining TV and web coverage
for the first time

19
00:01:25,040 --> 00:01:27,760
and streaming it live online

20
00:01:27,760 --> 00:01:29,800
- to make the experience more immersive.
- Be sure to tune in to our livestream.

21
00:01:29,880 --> 00:01:30,480
In addition,

22
00:01:30,720 --> 00:01:31,360
the company

23
00:01:31,360 --> 00:01:33,360
shared its future plans.

24
00:01:33,720 --> 00:01:34,760
It plans to invest in building

25
00:01:34,760 --> 00:01:36,840
a large park for immersive adventures.

26
00:01:37,040 --> 00:01:38,760
It should have room
for up to ten million players

27
00:01:38,880 --> 00:01:40,560
to take part
in on-site adventures simultaneously.

28
00:01:40,575 --> 00:01:45,075
(Live Analytics
Viewers: 538,500-578,600)

29
00:01:45,640 --> 00:01:46,400
Mr. Li,

30
00:01:46,640 --> 00:01:48,040
an Americano with milk and sugar,

31
00:01:48,160 --> 00:01:49,640
made just the way you like it.
Give it a try.

32
00:01:53,640 --> 00:01:54,440
I'm the director.

33
00:01:54,640 --> 00:01:55,600
Are you the influencer here, or am I?

34
00:02:03,880 --> 00:02:05,480
All vehicles, come on in now.

35
00:02:08,400 --> 00:02:08,800
They're here.

36
00:02:08,800 --> 00:02:09,720
It's the contestants' bus.

37
00:02:09,840 --> 00:02:10,280
Yeah.

38
00:02:11,000 --> 00:02:11,880
That's their bus.

39
00:02:12,680 --> 00:02:13,520
They're getting off!

40
00:02:14,600 --> 00:02:15,400
Players, this way.

41
00:02:16,640 --> 00:02:17,720
Journalists, please make way.

42
00:02:24,640 --> 00:02:25,280
Right this way,

43
00:02:27,080 --> 00:02:27,520
please.

44
00:02:27,520 --> 00:02:30,202
(Ghost Bride Guards the Gate of Rebirth:
I'll Reach the Final Level at Any Cost)

45
00:02:30,280 --> 00:02:31,000
Camera one in position.

46
00:02:31,720 --> 00:02:32,800
All right, put up the title.

47
00:02:33,053 --> 00:02:34,800
(The camera keeps shaking.
Can't see the escape room.)

48
00:02:34,800 --> 00:02:36,600
(Death wish compilation)

49
00:02:36,600 --> 00:02:38,360
Zhang, keep an eye
on the stream in the app.

50
00:02:38,520 --> 00:02:39,000
Got it.

51
00:02:39,160 --> 00:02:39,840
Cut to the interior.

52
00:02:39,960 --> 00:02:40,800
Done.

53
00:02:40,920 --> 00:02:41,600
Reset timecode.

54
00:02:41,720 --> 00:02:42,600
Timecode reset.

55
00:02:42,760 --> 00:02:43,640
Check the cameras inside.

56
00:02:43,880 --> 00:02:44,760
All cameras are working.

57
00:02:46,560 --> 00:02:47,480
Audio levels are set.

58
00:02:53,720 --> 00:02:55,120
Have the production team
order me some takeout.

59
00:03:12,280 --> 00:03:12,760
Hurry up.

60
00:03:46,640 --> 00:03:47,600
(Keep Quiet)
Is your phone ringing?

61
00:03:48,000 --> 00:03:48,600
Answer it.

62
00:03:49,480 --> 00:03:50,400
That's not a ringtone.

63
00:03:50,640 --> 00:03:52,240
The crew's playing background music

64
00:03:52,360 --> 00:03:53,200
to set the mood.

65
00:03:54,880 --> 00:03:55,360
Hello?

66
00:03:55,880 --> 00:03:56,560
Zhen?

67
00:03:57,280 --> 00:03:58,400
It's Daqiang.

68
00:03:58,960 --> 00:04:00,680
(Maintain Decorum)
You finally called me back.

69
00:04:01,520 --> 00:04:02,720
(Oh, Daqiang.)

70
00:04:03,040 --> 00:04:05,040
(You actually went
on the escape room show?)

71
00:04:05,240 --> 00:04:06,640
(I saw the livestream in my feed.)

72
00:04:06,760 --> 00:04:08,200
(You're getting all the screen time.)

73
00:04:08,280 --> 00:04:09,320
(You're about to go viral!)

74
00:04:09,760 --> 00:04:10,280
Zhen,

75
00:04:10,960 --> 00:04:12,280
I wish you a happy marriage.

76
00:04:12,560 --> 00:04:13,120
(Daqiang,)

77
00:04:13,640 --> 00:04:14,720
(if you go viral,)

78
00:04:15,000 --> 00:04:17,160
(I'll get back together with you.)

79
00:04:17,680 --> 00:04:19,040
(Li Daqiang, you're out.)

80
00:04:19,920 --> 00:04:20,720
(It says here)

81
00:04:20,840 --> 00:04:22,320
(you're out for answering a call)

82
00:04:22,520 --> 00:04:23,360
(without permission.)

83
00:04:23,560 --> 00:04:24,680
(My wedding's at the end of the month.)

84
00:04:24,960 --> 00:04:26,440
(Don't forget to send a cash gift.)

85
00:04:29,800 --> 00:04:30,560
Zhen said...

86
00:04:30,800 --> 00:04:31,440
I heard her.

87
00:04:33,000 --> 00:04:34,480
I think I'm out.

88
00:04:36,560 --> 00:04:37,440
Drop the "I think" phrase.

89
00:04:38,520 --> 00:04:39,200
I knew

90
00:04:39,640 --> 00:04:41,400
I'd get kicked out for keeping my phone.

91
00:04:41,800 --> 00:04:43,360
But Zhen called me back,

92
00:04:43,680 --> 00:04:45,000
and that's all I wanted.

93
00:04:46,960 --> 00:04:47,560
It's okay.

94
00:04:47,960 --> 00:04:49,960
People who've truly loved
don't go down that easily.

95
00:04:50,720 --> 00:04:52,560
(Keep Quiet)
But I still got eliminated.

96
00:05:05,933 --> 00:05:07,021
(Escape Room Terror
The camera keeps shaking.)

97
00:05:07,021 --> 00:05:08,488
(Can't make out the escape room.
They're just talking away.)

98
00:05:08,488 --> 00:05:09,965
(Girl, go hide!
What a death wish compilation.)

99
00:05:09,965 --> 00:05:11,553
(This is such a letdown.
Same old gimmicks. I'm over it.)

100
00:05:11,560 --> 00:05:12,880
Darn it! You're useless!

101
00:05:13,444 --> 00:05:14,760
(Boring. Yeah, exactly.)

102
00:05:14,760 --> 00:05:16,520
(The story's nothing special.
No chemistry. Hard to get into it.)

103
00:05:16,520 --> 00:05:18,760
More and more viewers are tuning out.

104
00:05:20,320 --> 00:05:22,000
Our viewer retention is low.

105
00:05:23,400 --> 00:05:24,960
I knew it. All style, no substance.

106
00:05:26,080 --> 00:05:27,000
It's too repetitive.

107
00:05:27,520 --> 00:05:28,560
Viewers get bored fast.

108
00:05:29,480 --> 00:05:31,640
The viewer count's dropped again.

109
00:05:32,200 --> 00:05:32,673
(Viewers: 208,000-190,000)

110
00:05:32,673 --> 00:05:34,480
(Viewers: 190,000-213,000)

111
00:05:36,560 --> 00:05:37,600
D-Director, look.

112
00:05:38,560 --> 00:05:39,479
(October 28th, 2025, Tuesday, 12:02:13)

113
00:05:39,480 --> 00:05:40,400
(D-Don't run!)

114
00:05:40,440 --> 00:05:41,120
(Stop following me!)

115
00:05:41,240 --> 00:05:41,960
I'll switch it.

116
00:05:42,240 --> 00:05:42,920
Turn up the volume.

117
00:05:45,520 --> 00:05:46,080
I need to talk to you.

118
00:05:46,160 --> 00:05:46,800
Don't run!

119
00:05:51,200 --> 00:05:51,880
(Yi Gyubo)
Where's Lin Duo?

120
00:05:54,320 --> 00:05:55,120
No talking.

121
00:05:55,240 --> 00:05:55,920
No talking.

122
00:05:58,320 --> 00:05:59,240
Stop running!

123
00:05:59,960 --> 00:06:00,640
Wait up!

124
00:06:00,990 --> 00:06:01,837
(The streamer never walks us
through the puzzles.)

125
00:06:01,837 --> 00:06:02,903
(We never see the clues when it counts.)

126
00:06:02,960 --> 00:06:05,320
(Viewers: 266,000-296,000)

127
00:06:16,080 --> 00:06:16,960
Where is Lin Duo?

128
00:06:17,520 --> 00:06:18,360
I'm her husband.

129
00:06:19,040 --> 00:06:19,760
Don't be scared.

130
00:06:19,880 --> 00:06:20,240
No, I...

131
00:06:20,240 --> 00:06:21,760
You're the first ghost
I've run into today.

132
00:06:22,360 --> 00:06:25,640
You just won't give up, will you?

133
00:06:25,920 --> 00:06:26,840
Could you stop talking?

134
00:06:27,120 --> 00:06:28,640
If Lin Duo and I get kicked out,

135
00:06:28,760 --> 00:06:29,560
it'll ruin the game for everyone.

136
00:06:30,080 --> 00:06:30,520
You...

137
00:06:31,040 --> 00:06:31,720
Don't talk.

138
00:06:32,200 --> 00:06:33,240
I'm wearing a mic.

139
00:06:36,120 --> 00:06:37,080
Then whisper it to me.

140
00:06:38,400 --> 00:06:38,960
You're unbelievable.

141
00:06:41,400 --> 00:06:42,160
Who's Lin Duo?

142
00:06:42,920 --> 00:06:43,840
Why is her husband chasing her?

143
00:06:44,600 --> 00:06:45,840
Lin Duo's an NPC

144
00:06:46,040 --> 00:06:47,920
set to ambush players
in the third-floor women's room.

145
00:06:48,600 --> 00:06:50,200
Turn on Lin Duo's mic.

146
00:06:50,680 --> 00:06:51,520
Get every camera

147
00:06:51,520 --> 00:06:52,960
on Lin Duo and her husband.

148
00:06:53,800 --> 00:06:54,560
Give it a title.

149
00:06:56,240 --> 00:06:59,240
"I'm a Ghost, and My Contestant Husband
Wouldn't Stop Chasing Me."

150
00:07:02,080 --> 00:07:02,640
Lin Duo,

151
00:07:03,160 --> 00:07:04,960
now do exactly as I say.

152
00:07:05,760 --> 00:07:07,000
Leave your station.

153
00:07:07,120 --> 00:07:08,640
Go to the morgue
and wait for instructions.

154
00:07:13,720 --> 00:07:14,680
Any other instructions?

155
00:07:19,040 --> 00:07:20,200
The director says

156
00:07:20,400 --> 00:07:22,480
that if you do as he says,
you'll win Lin Duo over.

157
00:07:24,240 --> 00:07:25,720
I've already sent Lin Duo

158
00:07:25,720 --> 00:07:26,800
to your area.

159
00:07:28,640 --> 00:07:29,080
Hello?

160
00:07:29,400 --> 00:07:30,320
When you see Lin Duo,

161
00:07:30,480 --> 00:07:31,720
stay hidden.

162
00:07:32,480 --> 00:07:34,400
Wait for my cue to say the key line,

163
00:07:34,520 --> 00:07:35,120
and you're golden.

164
00:07:36,160 --> 00:07:37,440
Hello? Are you still there?

165
00:07:38,640 --> 00:07:39,840
I didn't catch a word of that.

166
00:07:40,600 --> 00:07:41,200
Why'd the audio cut out?

167
00:07:41,652 --> 00:07:42,973
(Why is a player chasing an NPC?
This is kind of fun.)

168
00:07:42,973 --> 00:07:44,513
(Cut to it already! I want to see!
Finally, something's happening.)

169
00:07:44,513 --> 00:07:45,400
(They must be out of breath by now.
Now I've seen everything.)

170
00:07:45,400 --> 00:07:46,400
(Morgue)

171
00:07:50,480 --> 00:07:51,920
Are you sure I should go in now?

172
00:07:52,600 --> 00:07:54,480
When the player says he loves you,
say you feel the same.

173
00:07:56,600 --> 00:07:58,040
I said to tell him you feel the same.

174
00:07:58,680 --> 00:07:59,880
Tell him you feel the same!

175
00:08:00,040 --> 00:08:00,760
Can you hear me?

176
00:08:00,836 --> 00:08:02,576
(Nothing surprising.
Too slow. Barely any interaction.)

177
00:08:03,040 --> 00:08:03,560
Lin Duo!

178
00:08:04,920 --> 00:08:05,520
Lin Duo!

179
00:08:38,880 --> 00:08:45,617
(Off Duty)

180
00:09:13,240 --> 00:09:14,520
Why didn't you wait for my cue?

181
00:09:22,200 --> 00:09:22,720
Lin Duo,

182
00:09:24,120 --> 00:09:24,680
let's get married

183
00:09:25,920 --> 00:09:27,040
as soon as the rain stops.

184
00:09:29,360 --> 00:09:30,960
(As soon as the rain stops.)

185
00:09:48,630 --> 00:09:50,356
(All buffs stacked.
Barely any screen presence.)

186
00:09:50,480 --> 00:09:50,960
Say your line.

187
00:09:51,680 --> 00:09:52,640
Say the line I gave you!

188
00:09:52,640 --> 00:09:53,680
Your line! Your line!

189
00:09:53,680 --> 00:09:54,640
Say it!

190
00:09:54,640 --> 00:09:56,280
Say it
before everyone leaves the stream!

191
00:09:56,280 --> 00:09:58,560
Say "I love you."
Quick, say "I love you"!

192
00:10:00,480 --> 00:10:01,160
Lin Duo,

193
00:10:02,720 --> 00:10:03,520
I love you.

194
00:10:10,680 --> 00:10:11,520
Why are you saying that line?

195
00:10:11,680 --> 00:10:12,240
It's not your line.

196
00:10:12,240 --> 00:10:13,120
You're not the male lead.

197
00:10:13,120 --> 00:10:14,320
Why are you saying that line?

198
00:10:20,280 --> 00:10:21,840
The signal cut out!

199
00:10:22,040 --> 00:10:25,320
I just heard you!

200
00:10:25,369 --> 00:10:26,735
(Now that's drama...
The full horror package.)

201
00:10:26,735 --> 00:10:27,360
(Can't watch this anymore. I'm out.)

202
00:10:28,240 --> 00:10:28,760
Say...

203
00:10:33,000 --> 00:10:34,480
This event was a spectacular failure.

204
00:10:34,480 --> 00:10:35,760
What are your plans now?

205
00:10:35,920 --> 00:10:37,400
Are you going home
to take over the family business?

206
00:10:37,400 --> 00:10:38,720
That may be your only option now.

207
00:10:39,040 --> 00:10:40,120
Here's what I'm thinking.

208
00:10:40,240 --> 00:10:41,000
I'll go home...

209
00:10:41,440 --> 00:10:41,920
Xixi!

210
00:10:43,120 --> 00:10:43,640
Excuse me.

211
00:10:44,760 --> 00:10:45,240
Xixi,

212
00:10:45,720 --> 00:10:47,680
I'm going home
to take over the family business.

213
00:10:48,720 --> 00:10:50,000
What kind of job will you look for?

214
00:10:50,760 --> 00:10:51,200
Hello?

215
00:10:51,920 --> 00:10:53,280
Whatever I do, I'm done going all in.

216
00:10:53,280 --> 00:10:54,720
I sent you the cash gift
for your wedding.

217
00:10:56,400 --> 00:10:57,000
Yeah.

218
00:10:57,160 --> 00:10:58,160
Say your line.

219
00:10:59,120 --> 00:11:00,120
I need to get back to work.

220
00:11:00,240 --> 00:11:00,920
Bye.

221
00:11:01,240 --> 00:11:02,280
- Say your line.
- Excuse me, sir.

222
00:11:02,680 --> 00:11:03,640
- Your takeout.
- Say your line.

223
00:11:03,640 --> 00:11:04,600
Your takeout!

224
00:11:07,240 --> 00:11:07,920
Okay, thanks.

225
00:11:08,680 --> 00:11:09,240
Hello, sir.

226
00:11:10,120 --> 00:11:11,400
Okay, I'll be right there.

227
00:11:15,000 --> 00:11:15,440
Duo!

228
00:11:16,640 --> 00:11:17,120
I'm sorry.

229
00:11:17,920 --> 00:11:18,560
I blew it.

230
00:11:19,200 --> 00:11:21,560
I wanted to make a special impression.

231
00:11:21,760 --> 00:11:22,600
A good one.

232
00:11:23,960 --> 00:11:25,000
I'm sorry. I messed up.

233
00:11:27,200 --> 00:11:28,240
Who are you, really?

234
00:11:30,040 --> 00:11:31,520
Do you believe in parallel universes?

235
00:11:33,080 --> 00:11:34,200
I'm asking who you are.

236
00:11:34,840 --> 00:11:36,360
The question is, who are you?

237
00:11:37,280 --> 00:11:37,920
Does that even

238
00:11:37,920 --> 00:11:39,240
answer my question?

239
00:11:39,640 --> 00:11:41,240
I'm Zhang Yongsen, your husband.

240
00:11:42,000 --> 00:11:43,520
If you believe in parallel universes,

241
00:11:43,840 --> 00:11:44,520
what I just told you

242
00:11:44,520 --> 00:11:45,680
shouldn't be hard to understand.

243
00:11:47,480 --> 00:11:49,040
You came from a parallel universe?

244
00:11:50,480 --> 00:11:51,200
To find me?

245
00:11:57,960 --> 00:11:58,840
Who are you, really?

246
00:11:59,360 --> 00:12:00,600
Someone who cares about you!

247
00:12:03,320 --> 00:12:04,960
Leave professional work
to the professionals.

248
00:12:04,960 --> 00:12:06,320
I kind of look up to that influencer.

249
00:12:06,760 --> 00:12:07,840
You admire him for having a stroke?

250
00:12:08,320 --> 00:12:08,960
Excuse me.

251
00:12:12,400 --> 00:12:14,080
Say something, creep.

252
00:12:19,360 --> 00:12:20,000
Let's start over.

253
00:12:21,882 --> 00:12:24,262
♪This is a story about you♪

254
00:12:24,280 --> 00:12:25,560
Do you believe in parallel universes?

255
00:12:26,080 --> 00:12:27,040
Don't worry about who I am

256
00:12:27,280 --> 00:12:28,800
or whether my answer
even matches your question.

257
00:12:28,800 --> 00:12:29,960
♪Your name♪

258
00:12:29,960 --> 00:12:30,800
Just tell me if you believe in them.

259
00:12:32,066 --> 00:12:34,299
♪I've said it too many times♪

260
00:12:34,400 --> 00:12:34,840
No.

261
00:12:35,920 --> 00:12:36,640
Say you do!

262
00:12:36,976 --> 00:12:40,839
♪In another universe,
things might be different♪

263
00:12:40,840 --> 00:12:41,600
I do.

264
00:12:42,760 --> 00:12:43,280
I...

265
00:12:44,375 --> 00:12:45,239
♪But your name♪

266
00:12:45,240 --> 00:12:45,760
I can't say it.

267
00:12:46,880 --> 00:12:47,320
You...

268
00:12:47,558 --> 00:12:49,353
♪Is still the only one I say♪

269
00:12:50,640 --> 00:12:51,360
I can't tell you.

270
00:12:51,950 --> 00:12:56,440
♪This is a story about you♪

271
00:12:59,273 --> 00:13:00,680
♪Your very existence♪

272
00:13:01,840 --> 00:13:03,160
I used to hate it

273
00:13:03,160 --> 00:13:04,200
when male leads in short dramas

274
00:13:04,520 --> 00:13:06,240
held back important information.

275
00:13:06,480 --> 00:13:07,480
But now I see.

276
00:13:09,080 --> 00:13:11,200
It does happen in real life.

277
00:13:11,800 --> 00:13:13,240
I can't say it.

278
00:13:15,640 --> 00:13:16,880
You're a perfectly decent guy.

279
00:13:17,840 --> 00:13:19,440
Too bad your mouth's just for show.

280
00:13:23,923 --> 00:13:26,560
♪You're where my time ends♪

281
00:13:26,601 --> 00:13:28,080
♪The way I go♪

282
00:13:28,247 --> 00:13:29,841
♪Every tide♪

283
00:13:29,875 --> 00:13:31,901
♪Gives way to you♪

284
00:13:31,954 --> 00:13:34,907
♪As the monsoon shifts around the bend♪

285
00:13:34,920 --> 00:13:35,800
Duo, off to work?

286
00:13:36,320 --> 00:13:37,320
Xiaodie, done for the day?

287
00:13:37,680 --> 00:13:38,120
Bye.

288
00:13:38,120 --> 00:13:39,320
♪I wait for your echo♪

289
00:13:42,800 --> 00:13:43,600
Morning, Duo.

290
00:13:48,760 --> 00:13:49,680
Care for some breakfast?

291
00:13:52,920 --> 00:13:53,600
You were right.

292
00:13:53,920 --> 00:13:55,520
It tastes the same
if you just take the filling out.

293
00:14:15,400 --> 00:14:18,120
(The strength
to fight off every negative emotion)

294
00:14:19,520 --> 00:14:21,280
(comes from having the courage,
even in danger,)

295
00:14:21,280 --> 00:14:22,960
(to laugh at yourself.)

296
00:14:24,240 --> 00:14:25,680
(Across countless parallel universes,)

297
00:14:26,160 --> 00:14:26,880
(maybe you're the one)

298
00:14:27,160 --> 00:14:28,680
(who can actually save Lin Duo.)

299
00:14:31,480 --> 00:14:32,040
(Can I)

300
00:14:33,480 --> 00:14:34,920
(really save Lin Duo?)

301
00:14:49,920 --> 00:14:50,880
Where am I?

302
00:14:57,960 --> 00:14:58,680
Yongsen...

303
00:14:59,680 --> 00:15:00,520
It's okay.

304
00:15:00,680 --> 00:15:01,200
You can

305
00:15:01,680 --> 00:15:02,800
take the exam again next year.

306
00:15:02,800 --> 00:15:03,440
I'll do it, too.

307
00:15:03,920 --> 00:15:04,960
I'll go back and repeat senior year.

308
00:15:06,440 --> 00:15:07,400
I got in.

309
00:15:10,480 --> 00:15:11,480
You big dummy!

310
00:15:17,600 --> 00:15:18,240
(Honey,)

311
00:15:19,760 --> 00:15:21,200
(I'll save you. I promise.)

312
00:15:30,950 --> 00:15:34,480
♪Does fate write every hello♪

313
00:15:34,510 --> 00:15:36,490
♪With a goodbye in mind?♪

314
00:15:42,437 --> 00:15:45,910
♪Does longing give us a beginning♪

315
00:15:46,037 --> 00:15:47,960
♪And leave us without an ending?♪

316
00:15:54,010 --> 00:15:58,750
♪I remember the way you breathe♪

317
00:16:00,023 --> 00:16:02,800
♪Countless versions of me♪

318
00:16:03,582 --> 00:16:09,200
♪All point in the same direction♪

319
00:16:09,709 --> 00:16:12,760
♪Toward you♪

320
00:16:14,934 --> 00:16:16,568
♪I'll find you♪

321
00:16:16,905 --> 00:16:19,840
♪In the silence as the world is reborn♪

322
00:16:20,321 --> 00:16:22,228
♪I'll find you♪

323
00:16:22,545 --> 00:16:25,440
♪In the instant
before anything is decided♪

324
00:16:26,006 --> 00:16:27,760
♪I'll find you♪

325
00:16:28,366 --> 00:16:31,160
♪In the gaps
where time overlaps and slips♪

326
00:16:31,772 --> 00:16:33,532
♪I'll find you♪

327
00:16:37,868 --> 00:16:39,568
♪I'll find you♪

328
00:16:39,688 --> 00:16:42,720
♪In the promises left unsaid♪

329
00:16:43,177 --> 00:16:44,770
♪I'll find you♪

330
00:16:45,347 --> 00:16:48,080
♪In every pause between heartbeats♪

331
00:16:48,806 --> 00:16:50,720
♪I'll find you♪

332
00:16:51,252 --> 00:16:54,000
♪Where the last faint light fades♪

333
00:16:54,600 --> 00:16:56,413
♪I'll find you♪

334
00:17:00,326 --> 00:17:05,680
♪I'll find you♪
